+Subject: [PATCH 1/4] tools: add llama-verifier - external speculative chain
+ verifier (V1 greedy)
+
+Standalone libllama binary with /vverify HTTP endpoint:
+- stateless protocol: full prefix per request, longest-match against trunk KV
+- chains verified in ONE llama_decode: chain0 on trunk seq0, branches via seq_cp
+- greedy accept (argmax match), first chain with j>0 wins, bonus always returned
+- committed branch copied back to trunk; bonus left out of KV (client re-sends it)
+- prefill_ms / verify_ms / round_ms split for honest cost curves
+---
